{"ts":1793394733694,"event":"done","summary":"PLAT-103 shipped. validateApp (libs-shared-contracts) now throws if owner is missing or empty; released as 2.0.0 (breaking, major bump) via CD. Billing (owner payments), core shell (owner platform) and reports (owner insights, not in ticket sub-tasks but also calls validateApp and would fail startup) now pass owner and moved to @mfe/shared-contracts ^2.0.0. All 4 PRs merged, CI and CD green. Assumptions: owner values are the package.json team fields, hardcoded in each app's validateApp call since the browser bundle cannot read package.json; empty check also rejects whitespace-only owners; reports was included under the acceptance criterion that every validateApp caller must still start."}
